author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: Strict close refusal headline remains bounded and never contains a partial flag token; Default output suppresses generic explanatory filler while structured recovery retains full missing fields and retry arguments; CLI regression verifies no mutation on refusal and actionable close recovery
parent: pm-f05lsg
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Strict-close guidance uses a short complete headline, puts one retry immediately below it, labels placeholder evidence templates, and bounds human legal domains with an accurate complete SDK discovery route."
expected_result: Agents see complete flag tokens and one actionable retry without duplicated boilerplate or misleading diagnostic promises.
actual_result: "Linked 72-test guidance cohort and real CLI close/config parser tests pass; regression asserts retry placement/uniqueness, optional recovery compatibility and history preservation. Larger CLI diagnostic restore remains separately tracked open in pm-v1kspa. Exact-head CI/re-review remains a delivery gate."
